  "content": "<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af67364e6961c7d301f6af56d97221dfb4206f09.png\" alt=\"Euphoria_Patches_Banner_By_Memokii\">\n</div>\n<br>\n</a><div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=rgb(149, 74, 195)&amp;labelColor=f091f6&amp;color=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;link=ttps://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3XF\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fchangelogs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"更新日誌\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Changelogs-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=rgb(149, 74, 195)&amp;labelColor=f091f6&amp;color=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;link=https://github.com/EuphoriaPatches/Changelogs\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Euphoria Patches\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Euphoria Patches-050b14?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=googlechrome&amp;logoColor=8d50bf&amp;label=官方網站&amp;labelColor=e797f3\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"支援\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17 - black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;label=支援&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=f091f6\">\n    </a>\n</div><h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/437130f3f10997f720ff0b788cb24cde3b3b8541.png\" alt=\"Euphoria_Patches_logo\" width=\"30\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; 一個 Complementary 光影的附加元件</h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e7b00cde9ddb9c5b8aa2132f65e46b634f3cb8c.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n</div>\n</a><br><ul>\n<li><strong>Euphoria Patches</strong>，一個 Complementary 光影（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Reimagined</ins></a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Unbound</ins></a>）的附加元件，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fSpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SpacEagle17</a> 開發。</li>\n<li>透過可選的手工製作功能擴展 Complementary。</li>\n<li>所有選項預設為停用，但可以個別啟用。<br>\n「熱門設定」分頁及預設配置檔可輕鬆套用常用選項。</li>\n</ul><strong>重要提示：使用此附加元件時請勿向 Emin 回報任何錯誤，聯絡資訊如下。</strong><h2>📥 安裝方式：</h2><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fhow-to-install\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>euphoriapatches.com/how-to-install/</ins></a></strong><h2>🔗 連結</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Patreon</ins></a> 上支援 SpacEagle17，即可取得預覽版本！</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>官方網站</ins></a></strong>：Euphoria Patches！</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fchangelogs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>更新日誌</ins></a></strong>：Euphoria Patches！</li>\n<li><strong>聯絡方式：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%25